msgid "We are very pleased that you are using the %s plugin within a few days."
msgstr "Nos alegra mucho que lleves unos días usando el plugin %s."

#: src/Review.php:166
msgid "Please rate plugin. It will help us a lot."
msgstr "Por favor, valora el plugin. Nos ayudará mucho."

